Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Experiment E14 behind TAXMAN_HUB_BRANCH: in a mixed
 conflict a hub of it is given away to the smooth moves or to the fibers, each
 child searched in a search space whose graph leaves out the other side's
 edges of the hub

