+    /// Experiment E14 (`hub_branch`): a node whose conflict is mixed gives a hub of it away in two ways, the fibers
+    /// (`S`) and the smooth moves (`F`) losing it, and searches each child in a search space of its own; whether it did.
+    /// The children are the node's promotions and candidates in the space, `None` if it has no game or the promotions
